This branch adds the MTP activation, minderfund address updates, and
replay protection values necessary to activate the Winter Solstice 2025
upgrade.

This branch also removes the script verify flags that rejected Taproot
outputs and `SIGHASH_LOTUS`. You can review the summary of these changes
[here](https://github.com/LotusiaStewardship/lotusd/blob/winter-solstice-2025/doc/upgrades/2025-winter-solstice.md)
